WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.700
Narrator: It hurt the fan, whose privacy is protected by law.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.000
Narrator: It hurt Security, whose work must not be filmed.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Narrator: It hurt the tournament.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Narrator: And it cost the marshal his job.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:30.800
Narrator: In the next thirty minutes you will learn the Code of Conduct as it really works on duty - phones, photos, social media, fans' data - and what accountability means.

